WEBVTT

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:03.040
To protect love and freedom!

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.160
My heart of justice shall turn into fury!

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.760
With which I shall vanquish all villains!

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.160
Mobile Sentai Battle Rangers!

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:54.920
Doremi!

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.580
In a little bit!

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.620
Return the princess!

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:00.380
Shut up!

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:02.600
Battle Red!

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.310
Alright, use your deathblow!

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:11.820
Lighting Comet Kick!

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.650
Yes!

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:19.100
Battle Red, go save the princess!

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:19.910
Doremi!

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.370
You'll be late to the Maho-dou!

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.450
Now's the good part!

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.020
Princess!

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.880
Princess, Princess!

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:31.880
It's Onpu-chan!

00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:34.070
Battle Red!

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:37.810
She's so cute!

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.840
Ojamajos - Battle for Justice!?

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.650
Lightning Comet Kick!

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.320
After I, Battle Red, easily defeat the Demon King,

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.830
it falls to me to save the Princess!

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:10.330
Princess, I'm here to save you.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:13.670
Thank you for saving me.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:14.670
You have my gratitude.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:18.260
Stop that! You aren't doing it right!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:24.750
And the Princess is our very own Segawa-san!

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:31.000
She was so cute!

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.580
Doremi-chan, you watched it too?

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:35.980
I-I was just imagining it.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.480
Is that so...?

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:48.800
Onpu-chan!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.000
What is it?

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:55.500
Please give me your autograph.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:57.860
Again?

00:03:58.850 --> 00:03:59.760
Please.

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.100
Alright. Let me see it.

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:05.940
Stop it, you guys!

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:09.940
You should know that idolizing Segawa-san in school...

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:12.190
is forbidden!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.140
Shut up!

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:16.860
Don't try to act so cool!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:26.450
Hey, hey! What are you arguing about?

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.040
I-It's nothing.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.050
That's right.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.250
What are you doing?

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:41.050
Hey, you! Didn't I tell you not to sign autographs at school!?

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.680
Come with me.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.420
Hurry up.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:51.430
Hey, it's all your fault that Onpu-chan got in trouble.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.810
Stop right there, vice principal!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.210
W-What is it?

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:03.680
Vice principal, what you are doing is wrong.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:06.660
You should be catching the people asking for the autograph.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.840
Segawa-san didn't do anything wrong.

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.210
If there is a problem then tell it to your homeroom teacher.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:12.290
Now get out of my way.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:20.630
The vice principal is too scary...

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.480
Eh? It's Onpu-chan.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:28.080
I wonder what happened.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.800
They went to the office.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.760
Segawa-san.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:36.220
Even though you are a popular idol, at school, you are a student.

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:38.060
We won't give you special treatment.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.660
Yes, sir...

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.500
She's gettin' lectured.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:47.070
The vice principal can go on for a long time.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:48.200
I feel sorry for her.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:54.570
And I don't really accept having a student like you act.

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:58.340
You should do that when you've grown up. Got it!?

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.230
School should be your priority, do you unde-

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.530
Vice principal.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.750
There's a call for you.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:04.340
Okay, okay.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:06.320
You wait here.

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:08.680
I'm not done with you yet.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:10.300
Yes, sir.

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.640
Jeez, give me a break.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.440
I have to go to work.

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.980
I can't stay here all day.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.330
She wants to transform here!?

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.030
We hafta stop her!

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.200
What are you doing?

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:31.470
Oh no...

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:38.460
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:41.130
Oh, about the meeting with the principal?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.070
Vice principal, please forgive me.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:50.050
How can I go in if you three are in my way?

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.880
O-Oh yeah.

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.190
Hey Hadzuki-chan, yer blockin' the door.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:55.840
Ah, I'm so sorry.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.130
Doremi-chan, move out of the way.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.190
Oh yeah...

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.480
That's quite enough.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.080
What should we do?

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:07.460
If we move, Onpu-chan will be found out!

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:13.030
Vice principal, what did my student, Segawa, do?

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.350
It's nothing.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:21.500
Segawa-kun is able to keep up with her acting and schoolwork. I was telling her that she's an outstanding student.

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:24.400
Don't tell me...

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.870
Onpu-chan used magic again...

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.710
She got us there...

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.890
Eh!? So you <i>did </i> use magic on the vice principal?

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.110
Well, he just kept running his mouth.

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:41.120
That's true, but...

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.290
Who cares?

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.020
Magic should be used for our convenience.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:44.860
That's not good at all!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.500
Yeah!

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.650
It's dangerous to alter people's thoughts with magic.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.570
You can't do that!

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:56.630
Like I <i>said</i>... I'm fine.

00:07:56.630 --> 00:08:01.370
Majo Ruka's magic charm will protect me.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.800
Didn't I already tell you this?

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.600
But that magic is...

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:08.170
Segawa-san!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.720
What is it?

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.890
Did the vice principal really let you go?

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:17.030
Yes, I'm fine.

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:18.220
Don't worry about me.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.780
Wait, Onpu-chan!

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.600
You can't, Doremi-chan.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:27.870
Yeah, you can't talk about magic in front of Amano-kun.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.870
I know that, but...

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:35.130
Segawa-san, yesterday's episode of Battle Rangers was fantastic.

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:36.800
You were so cute.

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.020
Thank you.

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:40.790
You're so good at acting.

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.510
You were just like a real princess.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:47.420
I was so moved.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.200
You really are amazing, Segawa-san.

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:52.160
Really?

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.050
Thank you.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:56.320
Yes, yes.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:00.360
Onpu-chan was so cute as the princess.

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.750
So y'did watch it.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.190
Ahh, it's Mama!

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:12.570
Hey, I'm about to go film Battle Rangers.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.590
Do you want to come along?

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:14.900
C-Can I?

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:19.120
Sure, as thanks for your compliments.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.990
Thank you, Segawa-san!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.320
Wait!

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:25.270
See you later!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.830
Onpu-chan!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.600
Man, we weren't even done talkin' yet.

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:37.230
That idiot from earlier got in Onpu-chan's car.

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:38.690
Screw it all!

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:40.550
I'll remember this!

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:44.760
I'll have you know that you can't keep Onpu-chan to yourself!

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:51.560
I don't think this will be good for Onpu-chan.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:54.130
What are you talking to yourself about?

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:08.830
~ Today, I must have you pay your magic spheres on your long, overdue bill. ~

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:09.710
Oh crap.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:14.090
Majo Rika!

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:24.220
I don't have any money!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.170
You really are a painful customer to deal with.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:30.170
Majo Ruka's never like this.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:31.800
What did you say!?

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:34.650
Well...

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.150
What?

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.240
Majo Ruka always pays up with a smile.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.890
She burns through a lot of magic spheres,

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:44.410
but she's still a good customer.

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:46.930
Did you hear that?

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:50.390
Onpu-chan burns through a lot of magic spheres.

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:54.840
She probably uses a lot of them to alter people's thoughts.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.960
This ain't good.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.150
Amano-kun.

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:14.890
Mobile Sentai Battle Rangers!

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.120
Battle Red!

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:29.830
Shake my hand!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.790
Thank you so much, Segawa-san.

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:11.040
I should thank you for complimenting on my acting.

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:15.020
Meeting Battle Red was like a dream!

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:15.740
Ow...!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:19.980
Those two are super suspicious.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:21.800
Later, and goodnight.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.700
Goodnight!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.880
This is scandalous!

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:31.390
Hey!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:39.070
You...

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:42.280
Is that idiot in your class?

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.900
Give this to him.

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:51.430
A-A letter of challenge?

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:52.840
I'm challenging him to a fight!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.500
You better give it to him!

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:06.430
It's a scoop! A big scoop!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:10.990
Big news, big news! It's a fight! A fight!

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:13.810
A fight?

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:15.850
After school today,

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:19.480
sixth grader Hashimoto and our Amano Kouta

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:23.550
will have a showdown in Misora Park!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.200
Amano-kun...

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:34.080
But why is that sixth grader Hashimoto challenging you to a fight?

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.750
It's because I told him he was wrong.

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:43.960
Hashimoto is that cocky fellow, right?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.820
Cocky fellow?

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.630
Yes, he always picks on underclassmen.

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:50.170
Picks on underclassmen?

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:54.840
He wants my autograph every day. It's a real pain.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.640
It's a real pain!?

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:59.170
Amano-kun, he issued you a letter of challenge.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:00.400
How do you feel right now?

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.020
I accept his challenge!

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:12.590
I, Battle Red, shall defeat those who disturb the world's order!

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:16.310
But he's not really all that bad.

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:19.210
He's my fan club's president.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:20.540
Please be merciful.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:26.100
Leave it to me, Princess.

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:27.430
P-Princess!?

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:29.720
I shall teach him a lesson.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.510
Oh no, he's really into it now.

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:35.420
Well, I can understand him.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:38.790
You can't, Doremi-chan. Fighting is bad!

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.670
Ah, yeah.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:42.930
That's why we can't leave him like this.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.140
I'm home.

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:48.950
I'm about to go shopping for dinner.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:52.010
Hey, what are we having today?

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.640
Pork with green peppers.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:54.910
What!?

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:58.700
You know I hate green peppers!

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:00.420
You can't be picky.

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:08.090
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:13.090
Have Mama take me out to eat!

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.520
I think we should eat out tonight.

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:27.150
You coward!

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:32.870
What are you thinking, bringing along partners in a one-on-one fight?

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.490
What did you say?

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:37.540
You brought a whole bunch of people too.

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:41.210
You guys...

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.840
Amano, we're here to help you!

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:47.770
Now it's three-on-three!

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:49.760
Thank you, Blue and Yellow!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.640
Blue? Yellow?

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.500
Hey, I want to be Pink.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.400
Doremi-chan.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.690
Cut it out.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.100
Let's go, Evil Demon King!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.610
W-Who you calling the Evil Demon King?

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:09.860
Silence! Justice is power!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:10.940
Power is love!

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.650
I hate evil, not people!

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:17.420
My punches will defeat that evil heart of yours!

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.200
Hey, hey, Amano-kun.

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:22.100
Are you an idiot?

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:24.190
Silence, Evil Demon King!

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:25.630
Get them!

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.050
Take this!

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:34.800
Oh no, they've started.

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:36.710
Hey, hey! What's wrong?

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:37.460
Silence!

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.140
Hey, this isn't good.

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:47.360
I'll go call the teacher.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.670
We really should stop 'em.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:50.910
Well then...

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.350
Let's use Magical Stage.

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:52.980
Right!

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:59.260
If only the Battle Rangers were here...

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:02.290
I'm sure they'd be able to solve this and look all cool!

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.600
Well then, let's do it.

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:06.020
Right!

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:22.420
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:25.530
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.360
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:32.660
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:39.390
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.760
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.030
Magical Stage!

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:05.270
Stop their fighting!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:14.110
W-What's thiiiiiis!?

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:17.570
Doremi-chan, you were thinking about heroes again, weren't you?

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:18.900
Now, let's go.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.850
Take this!

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:24.950
Say it! Say that you've lost!

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:25.950
No!

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.620
The hero never loses to the bad guys!

00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:32.120
In that case, take this!

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:33.820
Enough!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.200
You are...

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:42.640
We are...

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.660
Ojamajo Sentai - Majo Rangers!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.190
Oof, this is lame.

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:50.560
I'm so embarrassed!

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:56.230
Looks like they stopped.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:00.170
Doremi-chan, this is too embarrassing, so let's go.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.620
Call me Pink.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.910
Oh no, we've completely lost her.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:05.910
Hey, you guys...

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:10.530
T-Time out!

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:11.720
Ow! You dare hit me!

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:16.800
This is wrong.

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:20.930
This is wrong, this is wrong!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.800
This isn't a hero's battle!

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:28.810
It's just a regular fight.

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:30.990
And so what?

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:33.230
I'm the president of her fan club.

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:37.940
I can't forgive you for taking away our idol! Onpu-chan belongs to everyone!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.820
Hey, wait.

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:42.860
When did I take away Segawa-san?

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:45.430
I think they got their stories all mixed up...

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:49.030
I know all about it.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:51.960
I know that you rode in Onpu-chan's car and went on a date with her!

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:53.740
A date?

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:58.000
She only invited me to go see Battle Rangers.

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.410
Battle Rangers?

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:01.680
Yeah.

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:05.400
I'm the president of Misora's Hero Club!

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:07.570
He said Hero Club.

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:08.850
Kid's got a screw loose.

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:11.730
That sounds interesting!

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:15.370
Then you aren't Onpu-chan's fan?

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:17.740
We're just classmates.

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:20.490
Anyway, why are you always asking for her autograph?

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:25.400
That's because...

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:32.710
Actually my little sister is a huge fan of Onpu-chan.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:39.520
After I got her autograph, I then promised all of her friends that I'd get one for them too.

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:47.200
But Onpu-chan is so busy that I can only get them at school.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:50.480
You can have this.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.590
A photograph of Onpu-chan!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:58.080
I'll go run more of these so you can give them to your sister's friends.

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:00.280
You're not such a bad guy after all.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.800
It's because I'm a hero!

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:05.810
Then I'll give you a plastic model of the Battle Rangers.

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:09.110
My family owns a toy shop.

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:11.230
Wow man, you're a really good guy!

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:12.900
You sure change your mind quickly.

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:15.980
Teacher, this way, this way!

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:19.420
The teacher is coming, Doremi-chan!

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.880
Yeah, let's go!

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:21.420
Yeah!

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:29.420
T-They disappeared!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:33.780
Wow! They were real heroes!

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:37.340
Thank you, Majo Rangers!

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:42.480
Doremi-chan, you're so heavy.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:47.720
Harukaze, Fujiwara, Senoo, what are you three doing over there?

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:48.780
That's dangerous.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:51.240
Well...

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.940
Are you okay?

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:56.630
We're fine, we're fine.

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:58.610
Totally okay!

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:03.650
"My father doesn't love me."

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:07.430
That suspicion begins to form in Tamaki Reika's mind.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:09.570
All because we said that...

00:22:09.570 --> 00:22:10.630
And that...

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:12.680
And that too...

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:14.450
We said all that...

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:16.480
Seki-sensei and everyone in the class...

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.250
And of course, her father is worried too.

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:20.350
I'm sorry.

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:21.380
Tamaki.

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:23.320
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:25.960
Tearful Memories of Papa and the Fireworks.

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:29.000
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
